    <item>
      <title>নীল গোলাপ</title>
      <link>https://www.aajkaal.in/sunday-online/sunday-special-poems-by-debargya-saha-521414</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.aajkaal.in/sunday-online/sunday-special-poems-by-debargya-saha-521414</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:37:00 +0530</pubDate>
      <enclosure url="https://cdn.aajkaal.in/uploads/images/2026/11/22/c169ef6b-d875-42ab-a14c-2873295f06dd.webp" length="0" type="image/jpeg" />
      <media:content url="https://cdn.aajkaal.in/uploads/images/2026/11/22/c169ef6b-d875-42ab-a14c-2873295f06dd.webp" medium="image" />
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn.aajkaal.in/uploads/images/2026/11/22/c169ef6b-d875-42ab-a14c-2873295f06dd.webp" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:10px;" alt="নীল গোলাপ" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;বিস্ফোরণের খবরটুকু দেওয়ার পরেও&amp;#13;
নীল গোলাপের গন্ধে মাতাল একটা পাড়া &amp;#13;
পুঞ্জীভূত আগুন-ফাগুন, রংমশালে &amp;#13;
কলঙ্কিত আত্মীয় সব, বাস্তুহারা&amp;#13;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <source url="https://www.aajkaal.in/sunday-online/sunday-special-poems-by-debargya-saha-521414">Aaj Kaal</source>
    </item>
    <item>
