      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.aajkaal.in/sunday-online/sunday-special-special-poems-521413</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:35:00 +0530</pubDate>
      <enclosure url="https://cdn.aajkaal.in/uploads/images/2026/11/22/c6a0824e-5a52-4fba-bc88-fab51fa3b569.webp" length="0" type="image/jpeg" />
      <media:content url="https://cdn.aajkaal.in/uploads/images/2026/11/22/c6a0824e-5a52-4fba-bc88-fab51fa3b569.webp" medium="image" />
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn.aajkaal.in/uploads/images/2026/11/22/c6a0824e-5a52-4fba-bc88-fab51fa3b569.webp" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:10px;" alt="মৃত্যুশোক ও বেহালাবাদক" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;রাত গভীর হলে বেহালাবাদক আসে!&amp;#13;
&amp;#13;
খুব সকালে উঠে &amp;#13;
খোঁজ নিই পরিজনদের।&lt;/p&gt;</description>
